00:08:46.393 --> 00:08:49.262
In the throat

00:08:49.262 --> 00:08:53.266
The Yàn (transliteration)&nbsp;is the uppermost opening of the esophagus.

00:08:53.266 --> 00:08:55.635
The Hóu (transliteration) is the uppermost opening&nbsp;

00:08:55.635 --> 00:08:57.604
of the trachea.

00:08:57.604 --> 00:09:00.073
So when you can't swallow

00:09:00.073 --> 00:09:02.175
It's a problem with the upper esophagus.

00:09:02.175 --> 00:09:03.877
When you have trouble breathing

00:09:03.877 --> 00:09:05.512
It's a tracheal problem

00:09:05.512 --> 00:09:06.813
This just distinguishes.

00:09:06.813 --> 00:09:07.580
What is Yàn (transliteration)

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:08.448
What is Hóu (transliteration)

00:09:08.448 --> 00:09:09.549
When you have a sore throat

00:09:09.549 --> 00:09:12.051
When it hurts so much that swallowing hurts

00:09:12.051 --> 00:09:13.453
You press with your fingers

00:09:13.453 --> 00:09:14.454
These two acupoints

00:09:14.454 --> 00:09:15.622
When you press

00:09:15.622 --> 00:09:16.823
It will be a little painful

00:09:16.823 --> 00:09:17.791
That's right

00:09:17.791 --> 00:09:19.859
That is to say, you press the right place

00:09:19.859 --> 00:09:22.228
Press for 1 to 3 minutes

00:09:22.228 --> 00:09:24.531
Relieves sore throat quickly

00:09:24.531 --> 00:09:26.833
I remember more than 20 years ago

00:09:26.833 --> 00:09:29.536
Have had a goiter before

00:09:29.536 --> 00:09:32.038
It's inflammation in the&nbsp;Yān hóu(transliteration).

00:09:32.038 --> 00:09:33.373
press here

00:09:33.373 --> 00:09:35.508
Then press the thyroid gland.

00:09:35.508 --> 00:09:37.377
It's a thyroid problem&nbsp;caused

00:09:37.377 --> 00:09:38.678
by throat inflammation.

00:09:38.678 --> 00:09:40.613
Then you press the&nbsp;Yān hóu(transliteration).

00:09:40.613 --> 00:09:42.449
You can treat your thyroid problems

00:09:42.449 --> 00:09:43.349
Also solved

00:09:43.349 --> 00:09:45.018
1 movement supplements lung qi

00:09:45.018 --> 00:09:47.253
Can see things clearly at night.

00:09:47.253 --> 00:09:48.621
Give you another bonus

00:09:48.621 --> 00:09:50.557
If you keep coughing

00:09:50.557 --> 00:09:52.659
Eyes will become presbyopic again

00:09:52.659 --> 00:09:54.060
I'll teach you a trick

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:56.796
In&nbsp;Yǎngshēng dǎo yǐn fǎ (transliteration)

