This action can replenish lung qi

00:10:23.223 --> 00:10:24.791
Eliminate Qi deficiency

00:10:24.791 --> 00:10:26.126
caused by qi deficiency

00:10:26.126 --> 00:10:27.360
blurred vision

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:29.129
You often do this action

