Qi and blood gas station for the eyes

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:55.455
Help you

00:10:55.455 --> 00:10:56.489
Open up the meridians

00:10:56.489 --> 00:10:57.190
Bī hán qì (transliteration)

00:10:57.190 --> 00:10:58.191
Nourishing the lungs

