More energetic body

00:11:16.843 --> 00:11:19.479
How to make apple onion water

00:11:19.479 --> 00:11:22.949
1.Two apples and an onion

00:11:22.949 --> 00:11:24.551
Cut into small pieces and set aside

00:11:24.551 --> 00:11:26.252
2.Prepare a large bowl

00:11:26.252 --> 00:11:27.587
Turn the empty cup upside down

00:11:27.587 --> 00:11:29.222
Place in the center of the bowl

00:11:29.222 --> 00:11:32.058
3.Place the chopped apples and onions

00:11:32.058 --> 00:11:33.860
evenly in the bowl

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:35.194
around the cup.

00:11:35.194 --> 00:11:37.931
4.Add 500cc of water to the outer pot

00:11:37.931 --> 00:11:39.766
5.Cover the pot

00:11:39.766 --> 00:11:41.034
Start the rice cooker

00:11:41.034 --> 00:11:43.069
6.During the cooking process

00:11:43.069 --> 00:11:44.771
The cup will automatically suck in.

00:11:44.771 --> 00:11:47.073
7.Remove the cup when finished

00:11:47.073 --> 00:11:48.207
There is in the cup

00:11:48.208 --> 00:11:50.210
Apple and Onion Water

